{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20305",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 5.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "I mean, hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.74,
      "end_seconds": 10.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "no problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.75,
      "end_seconds": 27.75,
      "duration_seconds": 16.0,
      "text": "I've been dealing with a painful rash on one side of my chest. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.08,
      "end_seconds": 32.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Right, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.79,
      "end_seconds": 43.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "I've had it for about four days. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.74,
      "end_seconds": 47.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Is anything making it worse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.69,
      "end_seconds": 52.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Yes, touch and clothes rubbing. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.14,
      "end_seconds": 57.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.75,
      "end_seconds": 60.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.72,
      "end_seconds": 78.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "any rash on the other side, confusion or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.73,
      "end_seconds": 86.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "I haven't had rash on the other side, confusion or weakness, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.6,
      "end_seconds": 90.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.95,
      "end_seconds": 92.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.42,
      "end_seconds": 95.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.39,
      "end_seconds": 98.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.79,
      "end_seconds": 102.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.61,
      "end_seconds": 107.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.26,
      "end_seconds": 113.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.67,
      "end_seconds": 116.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "no surgery, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.95,
      "end_seconds": 122.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.36,
      "end_seconds": 135.28,
      "duration_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.97,
      "end_seconds": 148.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.88,
      "end_seconds": 156.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "Years back I got a rash from trimethoprim, so I stay away from it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.92,
      "end_seconds": 179.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.05,
      "end_seconds": 183.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Ramipril. I take it every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.37,
      "end_seconds": 187.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.12,
      "end_seconds": 190.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.85,
      "end_seconds": 196.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.12,
      "end_seconds": 201.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Right, take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.97,
      "end_seconds": 230.45,
      "duration_seconds": 10.48,
      "text": "There are clustered blisters on a red base in a band across the right side of the chest, not crossing the midline."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.84,
      "end_seconds": 235.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.74,
      "end_seconds": 253.77,
      "duration_seconds": 11.03,
      "text": "taking everything into account, it's hard to say. Shingles is one possibility and a herpes simplex rash another, and I'd rather not commit yet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.76,
      "end_seconds": 258.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "is this serious, uh, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.74,
      "end_seconds": 270.89,
      "duration_seconds": 11.15,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now shingles is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's book a swab from a blister to look into vesicular rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 272.26,
      "end_seconds": 276.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "I can book that for Tuesday at 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.38,
      "end_seconds": 278.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.7,
      "end_seconds": 302.58,
      "duration_seconds": 19.88,
      "text": "I'm gonna put you on aciclovir, 800 milligrams, five times a day, for seven days. You take it by mouth. That's for shingles. Keep the rash clean and dry and avoid contact with pregnant women or newborns until the the blisters crust over. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.14,
      "end_seconds": 306.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}